    "assumptions": [
      "The source uses a tenant-specific Atlassian host, so the site subdomain must be provided as a connection setting.",
      "The source does not document numeric maximum page sizes, so the manifest uses 50 users per page and 100 audit records per page.",
      "The user-list response is an array and does not document total or has-more fields, so pagination relies on the runtime's short-page stopping behavior.",
